      "content": "i tried calling the pharmacy but they were super busy and basically just told me to talk to my doctor which is what i'm trying to avoid lol. i'm pretty sure i'm just overreacting. i also have some stage 2 kidney issues that my doc mentioned a few years ago but i havent checked in a bit. do u think the magnesium is actually dangerous for my kidneys or is it just the dose that's messing with me? if i just take like 200mg it should be totally fine right? i really need those cramps to stop.",
